<%# "J'ai arrosé" button of the open watering of a plant (lists use TaskRowComponent's round button). The main action
    when due or late; before, watering early stays possible, as a secondary button. The accessible name starts with
    the visible text (voice control). %>
<% variant = occurrence.due_by? ? :primary : :secondary %>
<%= button_to(
  task_occurrence_completion_path(occurrence),
  aria: { label: t("task_row_component.done_watering", name: occurrence.task.subject.name) },
  class: [ button_class(variant), "shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap" ]
) do %>
  <%= icon(:check) %><%= t("plants.water") %>
<% end %>